	{"fin_factor_alpha", "Portfolio, Matrix, And Factor Analytics", "Annualized single-factor alpha; alias of `fin_alpha`.", "SELECT fin_factor_alpha(r, factor_r, risk_free := 0.0, annualization := 252);"},
